  vendorName: Consultant Blackwood
  offerText: Your posture is appalling. Pay my fee, and I will deliver a massive,
    state-of-the-art ergonomic chair that will cure your physical ailments immediately.
  acceptResultText: The giant chair arrives. The moment you sit down, a poorly designed
    lumbar piece snaps, violently bruising your spine and leaving you in agonizing
    pain.
  rejectResultText: You refuse the overpriced furniture. You stand up, stretch your
    back naturally, and feel perfectly fine.
